<blockquote class="uncited"><div>A quick question about the compound collision objects:<br><br>As far as I can see these will be fully shareable just like any other bullet shape. Am I correct in this assumption? I just had a bad awakening using a different Physics Engine where compound shapes cannot be shared (whilst all others can).</div></blockquote>Indeed, CompoundShape can be shared.<br>A compound-sharing example is available CcdPhysicsDemo, if you enable 'compound'.<br><br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Sat Aug 05, 2006 7:46 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
