		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=1382#p1382"><![CDATA[
A new source code drop is available:<ul><li>* Compound Collision Shapes (initial version, not optimized)<br>* New MacOS-X (i386) precompiled COLLADA physics viewer<br>* StaticPlaneShape emulates an infinite plane using GJK<br>* ParallelIslandDispatcher,ParallelPhysicsEnvironment<br>* Generic6DofConstraint</li></ul>Collada Physics Viewer 0.7 (ColladaDemo) , using COLLADA-DOM:<ul><li>* Support for COLLADA import/export of compound shapes (more then one collision shape)<br>* Support for COLLADA import/export of generic D6 constraints (no limits/motors)<br>* &lt;mesh&gt;, &lt;convex_mesh&gt; support</li></ul><a href="http://www.continuousphysics.com/mediawiki-1.5.8/index.php?title=Download" class="postlink">http://www.continuousphysics.com/mediaw ... e=Download</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Tue Jul 25, 2006 1:22 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
